SUMMARY:Closure: ARSENAL STATION: Arsenal station is closed due to 
 infrastructure damage within the station. We are assessing the problem and
  will work to reopen the station as quickly as possible\, but the station 
 is expected to remain closed this weekend and into the following week.\n
  \nWhile this station is closed\, you are advised to use local buses and 
 alternative nearby stations including Finsbury Park\, Holloway Road or 
 Highbury & Islington.
